This project is governed centrally by `coding_agent/`, not by this file.

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root first for the required reading order
(`coding_agent/00_AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md` onward) and the list of other agents
working in this project. Do not restate or fork those rules here.

The three non-negotiables: never assume — ask with options and a recommendation;
never claim done without running the verification commands; never push without
approval, noting the standing grant recorded in
`coding_agent/02_COLLABORATION_PROTOCOL.md` §1 and its limits.

> If `coding_agent/` lives somewhere other than the repository root in this
> project, adjust the prefix in the paths above to match. Everything inside that
> folder is written relative to the folder itself and needs no changes.
